license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-16
keywords:
  - wind turbine
  - floating offshore wind
  - OpenFAST
  - linearization
  - modal analysis
  - mode identification
  - Campbell diagram
  - multi-blade coordinate transform
  - Floquet analysis
  - state space
